<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank sets new 7-day reverse repo,</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank sets new 7-day reverse repo,</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, set on Tuesday a new seven-day reverse repurchase operation at an unchanged fixed rate of 4.60 percent.</p>
<p>The repo will run from November 6 to November 13.</p>
</text>
